+# Upstream update procedure
+
+`origin` is the Jarvis repository. `upstream` points to `https://github.com/a-ghorbani/pocketpal-ai.git`.
+
+```bash
+git remote add upstream https://github.com/a-ghorbani/pocketpal-ai.git
+git fetch upstream --tags
+git switch main
+git switch -c chore/upstream-YYYY-MM-DD
+git merge --no-ff upstream/main
+corepack yarn install --frozen-lockfile
+corepack yarn l10n:validate
+corepack yarn typecheck
+corepack yarn test --runInBand
+cd android
+./gradlew assembleProdRelease -PreactNativeArchitectures=arm64-v8a
+```
+
+Resolve conflicts by preserving upstream behavior first, then reapplying changes marked `JARVIS`. New Jarvis code belongs under `src/agent`, `src/voice`, and `android/app/src/main/java/top/authorche/agent`. Do not rename the complete upstream Kotlin namespace during routine updates.
+
+Never replace `android/app/jarvis-authorai-release.keystore`. Changing it makes existing installations unable to accept updates.
+
